    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt"><b><i>First Earnout Milestone &#8211; </i></b>3,000,000 Earnout Consideration Shares shall become payable upon the closing price of PubCo&#8217;s ordinary shares, as reported on The Nasdaq Stock Market LLC (or any other national securities exchange on which such shares are then listed), reaching or exceeding $15.00 per share for 60 consecutive trading days occurring at any time during the three-year period commencing on the closing date.</span></td></tr>
