    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">the identities of company security holders who sold to our sponsor, directors, officers, advisors or their affiliates (if not purchased on the open market) or the nature of company security holders (<i>e.g</i>., 5% security holders) who sold to our sponsor, directors, officers, advisors or their affiliates; and</span></td></tr>
