<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 49.5pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -24pt">&#160;</p>

<table cellspacing="4" cellpadding="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
