    <td style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-size: 10pt">duty to exercise powers for the purposes for which those powers were conferred and not for a collateral purpose and directors shall not act, or agree to act, in a matter that contravenes the Companies Act or the memorandum and articles of association;</span></td></tr>
