<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Transaction costs amounted to $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--PaymentOfFinancingAndStockIssuanceCosts_c20240918__20240919__us-gaap--SubsidiarySaleOfStockAxis__us-gaap--IPOMember_zlNBdFdsSk6k" title="Transaction costs"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:PaymentOfFinancingAndStockIssuanceCosts" contextRef="From2024-09-182024-09-19_us-gaap_IPOMember" id="Fact000410" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">2,840,203</ix:nonFraction></span>, consisting
