<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On December 18, 2023, the Company issued <span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues_c20231217__20231218__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--FounderSharesMember_zFu1Vh1fgwZj" title="Stock issued new, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" contextRef="From2023-12-172023-12-18_custom_FounderSharesMember" id="Fact000655" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">10,000</ix:nonFraction></span>
